ABBAS QATL HOGAYE TANHA HUE HUSSAIN,<br>
 THAME KAMAR KO ROTA HAI ZEHRA KA NOOR-E-AIN<br>
<br>
SHAANE KATE HUE HAI TOH SAR HAI SHIGAFTA,<br>
 BHAI KE ZAKHM DEKHTE HAIN ROOTE HAIN HUSSAIN<br>
<br>
SHEH SE SAKINA KEHTI THI ABBAS HAIN KAHAN,<br>
 KAISE TASALLI DEIN USSE AB SHAHE MASHRAQAIN<br>
<br>
PAANI NA MANGONGI KABHI AMMU AB AA BHI JAO,<br>
 KARTI THI BAS YE PYAASI SAKINA TADAP KE BAIN<br>
<br>
PARDE KA UNKE HAYE MOHAFIZ NAHI RAHA,<br>
 MUSHKIL KUSHA KI BETIYAN KARTI HAIN SHOR-O-SHAIN<br>
<br>
SUB KO DILASA DETI HAIN BINTE ALI MAGAR,<br>
 KIS TARHA AYE ZAINAB-E-MUZTAR KE DIL KO CHAIN<br>
<br>
BE DAST GHAZI GHODE SE KIS TARHA SE GIRA,<br>
 MAIN LIKH RAHA HOON BINTE NABI KAR RAHI HAIN BAIN<br>
<br>
UMMUL BANEEN KE LAAL PA ROTE HAIN HUM RASHEED,<br>
 ZEHRA KE DIL KO MILTA HAI IN AANSUON SE CHAIN